    "date": 1681315356,
    "caption": "🤖 Attention all AI startups!\n\n🚀 We are excited to announce “The AI Battle”, a startup pitching competition in the field of artificial intelligence organized by Presight, a leading big data analytics company powered by Artificial Intelligence and Astana Hub. \n\nWe invite all aspiring startups working in the field of #ArtificialIntelligence, #ML, #BigData, #Data and in related verticals to showcase their projects, get feedback from experts and investors, and find new partners and clients.\n\n🗓 The event will be held on April 26th at Astana Hub (Astana, Mangilik El Ave. 55/8, Block C 4.6) and promises to be an exciting opportunity for AI startups to showcase their innovative products.\n\n💰With a chance to win cash prizes, the stakes are high!\n\n The prizes are as follows:\n🏆1st place — $10,000\n🥈2nd place — $5,000\n🥉3rd place — $3,000\n\n⚡️To participate, all you need is a startup project at the stage from MVP and above, that applies AI in its product and matches with Presight’s profile (www.presight.ai), and at least two key team members of your company. \n\n❗️Spots are limited. Battle application and more information on the participation criteria can be found using the link in the profile description. \n\nYou can also apply as a guest using the link in the profile description (taplink).\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to showcase your AI startup to a panel of expert judges and potentially win big! Deadline for applications: 20th of April.",
